  lines:
  - speaker: 1
    text: "T\u1EDB \u0111ang ph\u1EE5 ph\u1EA7n trang tr\xED."
  - speaker: 1
    text: "B\u1ECDn t\u1EDB c\xF2n thi\u1EBFu ng\u01B0\u1EDDi l\xE0m b\u1EA3ng."
  - speaker: 1
    text: "C\u1EADu c\xF3 mu\u1ED1n l\xE0m c\xF9ng kh\xF4ng?"
  - speaker: 1
    text: "Ch\u1EC9 m\u1ED9t ch\xFAt th\xF4i."
